Oh! Hi, everybody! The summer heat ends, but I have hot news for you!
The firefighter profession has been added.

List of fixed bugs:
1. Tweaked HUD;
2. Returned the text to the dialog cloud;
3. Polished the levels, now they can all be passed;
4. Fixed the balance of cars;
5. Fixed a bug with the displacement of the pilot relative to the car.

The release will be very soon. 

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41519763/5ce2f5c6fcea2dc940d737a944266125a5f2cc9b.jpg

List of changes:
Improved the music player;
Fixed bug with teleportation;
Improving the visual effects of steam and smoke;
Added loading screen.

Oh! Hi everybody! I continue to actively work on the project, thanks to the support of the fans. Many thanks to everyone for participating in the process.

List of improvements:
Fixed a bug with the disappearance of the cursor;
If you restarted the level, the music will continue to play from the same point;
Returned the sound from the machine gun;
Improved smoke effect;
A few more minor changes to the UI (work on the UI will continue later).

I continue to work on optimization and bug fixes, and a new "Racing" mode will be available soon.

List of updates:
1. Improved control;
2. Fixed bug with jumping sheep;
3. Reworked three levels for the Sheep Farm;
4. Changes to the UI.
